;; round01 cell b2a1's 絞首 KOSHU, ported by cell b3a2 onto b3a0's ledger: HS-B-AI-MOVE: the bind's TODOME (b2a0's) and the
;; cinching route: nothing off a block, a J link 2 (the route off), a K link 1 (the route off) or out of a bind; at HARD (its
